iant boulder with a sword placed in  between his jaws keeping them open  Fenrir had grown so big that when he  held the drool from his mouth formed the  lake during the Ragnarok Fenrir broke  free and ran throughout the world with  his lower jaw against the ground upper  jaw in the sky Fenrir devoured  everything in his path  before being killed by one of Odin's  sons Fenrir did manage to achieve the  revenge he craved by killing and  devouring Odin it is said that femoris  two sons skull and hearty followed in  their father's footsteps with one  swallowing the Sun and the other the  moon they destroyed the stars and all  essence of time the story of Henry is an  intriguing one I personally don't  believe that fenway was evil he only  desired to be accepted by his fellow  gods after years of being treated like a  beast he became the monster that  everybody thought he was if you've  enjoyed this video then please go ahead  and leave it a like consider subscribing  if folklore and mythology is something  that interests you if you have anything  you'd like to discuss or have any ideas  for future videos then please go ahead  and let me know in the comments below as  always I've been your host mythology and  folklore explained
 

